error[role-line-shape]: this `###` heading is not a role line
   --> errors-role.md:10:5
   |
10 | ### Projects
   |     ^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: level-3 headings are reserved for roles: a role line is `### Company · Title · 2019 – 2023` or `### Company · 2019 – 2023`; use `## ` for a section or `**Name · Period**` for an era

error[role-separator]: role parts must be separated by ` · `, not `|`
   --> errors-role.md:12:5
   |
12 | ### Acme | Engineer | 2015 – 2017
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ fixable
   |
   = help: did you mean `### Acme · Engineer · 2015 – 2017`?

